(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**No Ranged/Ammo column** — those slots are always **Animator** (and **Automaton Oil**) for your puppet to function. Don't gear them with anything else.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Augment your "Add-on" pieces.** Mirke Wardecors (body), Anwig Salade (head), and Desultor Tassets (legs) take Pet- or Master-side augments. Magic puppet → Pet MAB/M.Acc. Melee/ranged → Pet Att/Acc. Decide before you augment — it's a one-shot.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You pet DPS — Automaton / Maneuvers / Overdrive / Repair / Activate. Automaton doesn't benefit from party buffs — pick trusts that cover what your puppet's frame can't.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — Valoredge can tank but fragile in endgame</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Healer backup — Soulsoother needs specific attachments to be reliable</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>**Haste on you** (master gets Haste), Refresh, debuffs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal boost master melee + Valoredge/Sharpshot</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

